Moko: Hey, I need your help...
- Okay
	Moko: I will pay you well, just promise not to tell anyone...
	- Why can't I tell anyone?
		Moko: It might be, slightly illegal. BUT I WILL PAY YOU VERY WELL
		- Okay, so what is it?
			label The Quest
			Moko: I need you to KILL my ex-husband, his name is Wibble, ill give you a photo.
			- NO WAY!
				Moko: ARRg, BYE
			- Okay, Im in
				Moko: And as for how you are going to kill him...
				Moko: There is a gun dealer, he goes by the name Nephryl...
				Moko: Also to use the gun, click while pressing SPACE.

				if {has_gun} == true:
					Moko: And, it looks like you already have a gun!
					Moko: Here is the photo of him. FIND HIM AND KILL HIM!
					[signal arg="hitman_job_start"]
				else:
					Moko: He is a pretty common drinker at the bar too. He wears a trench coat and has a read head, he usually hangs around this area, you should be able to find him...
					Moko: Here is $20, this should be enough to buy the gun...
					Moko: Ill pay you the rest after the job...
					Moko: AND IF YOU RUN AWAY WITH MY MONEY AND DONT FINISH THE JOB, BAD, BAD THINGS WILL HAPPEN TO YOU!!
					Moko: Go find him to buy a gun. Then kill Wibble!
					Moko: Okay, here is the photo of him & the money!
					
					[signal arg="hitman_job_start"]
		- Im out
			Moko: uuurag, FINE, BYE...
	- Go on...
		jump The Quest
	- I don't wanna help you!
		Moko: uuurag, FINE, BYE...
